flowchart TD
    User[User Browser] -->|HTTPS 443| VIP[Virtual IP on HAProxy pair]
    VIP --> HAProxyA[HAProxy A (active)]
    VIP --> HAProxyB[HAProxy B (standby)]

    HAProxyA -->|HTTP 80| Web1[Nginx Web Server 1]
    HAProxyA -->|HTTP 80| Web2[Nginx Web Server 2]

    Web1 --> App1[App Server 1]
    Web2 --> App2[App Server 2]

    App1 --> DBPrimary[MySQL Primary]
    App2 --> DBReplica[MySQL Replica]
    DBPrimary -. replication .-> DBReplica

    Note[Issues: single MySQL writer, more ops overhead, latency checks needed]
